  "hoare:v1:f9931bec65b6cd4494399051cf0a8b03eabbbd4366026b5b0d4d084d8b43413b": "Create an invoice table in Sheet1. In column A, enter the column header \"Item\" and list three items below it: Desk, Chair, and Lamp. In column B, enter the column header \"Amount\" and list their amounts below it: 200, 75, and 40. In column C, enter the column header \"Tax Rate\" and list their tax rates below it: 0.08, 0.08, and 0.05. Then add column D with the header \"Tax Amount\" and calculate Amount multiplied by Tax Rate. Add column E with the header \"Final Amount\" and calculate Amount plus Tax Amount."
